<td id="A1.T7.2.1.6.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">0.0000</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.6.9" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">0.0123</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Toxicity and perplexity metrics across unlearning steps for challenge and non-challenge subsets. Step-wise application of forget (<math id="A1.T7.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\mu</annotation></semantics></math>) and retain (<math id="A1.T7.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>) weights reduces toxicity while maintaining perplexity.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Hyperparameters Settings</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the weight hyperparameters applied at each iteration, along with the corresponding evaluation scores for each task, in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.2 Prompt Formatting for NER ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Reveal and Release: Iterative LLM Unlearning with Self-generated Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Table <a href="#A1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.3 Hyperparameters Settings ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Reveal and Release: Iterative LLM Unlearning with Self-generated Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, and Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.3 Hyperparameters Settings ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Reveal and Release: Iterative LLM Unlearning with Self-generated Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
